{"id":"d08bb83a29b082b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-cor-lusin.md","title":"Lusin Corollary","display":"cor-lusin — Lusin Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-lusin","aliases":["58-cor-lusin"],"display":"cor-lusin — Lusin Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-lusin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-lusin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-lusin — Lusin Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a01ce7343b132090\" href=\"?note=a01ce7343b132090\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-meager.md\">../batch04/58-df-meager.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\">\\(E,F,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (Lusin-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a01ce7343b132090\" href=\"?note=a01ce7343b132090\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Meager}(F,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Meager}(F,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (meager-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-meager.md\">../batch04/58-df-meager.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S(E\\cap F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(E\\cap F)\\)</span> (countable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lusin} \\vdash \\forall E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to |E|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall F\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Meager}(F,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(E\\cap F)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lusin} \\vdash \\forall E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to |E|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall F\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Meager}(F,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(E\\cap F)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology parameter is explicit in both the Lusin-set and meager-set predicates, matching their upstream signatures.</li>\n<li>Every Lusin set has size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak c\\)</span> and meets each meager subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> in a countable set.</li>\n<li>CH implies their existence, but ZFC alone does not prove that a Lusin set exists.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"a01ce7343b132090","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-meager.md","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"a01ce7343b132090","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$ (Lusin-set predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-meager.md","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Meager}(F,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$ (meager-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headi